   117	Five processes online (`web`, `crm`, `chat`, `triage`, `worker`), uptime 35 h at
   118	time of capture. The `worker` process is emitting a repeating NATS JetStream
   119	`503` from a `[dead-letter-subscriber] tick failed` loop. A LiteLLM proxy runs
   120	on the same host on :4000 from `/app/config.yaml`, up since June 19.
   121	
   122	## C10 — Trust gate behaviour observed
   123	
   124	Method: orchestrator probes of `POST /app/api/public/live-preview` with curl.
   125	
   126	- Body without the client-timing field → 400, and the app logged
   127	  `[trust:rejected] ip=<addr> reason=missing_timing`.
   128	- Body with a plausible timing value but no Turnstile token → 400
   129	  `{"error":"Bot verification required","code":"TURNSTILE_REQUIRED"}`.
   130	- Two headless browsers on hosts whose egress could not reach
   131	  `brunhild.challenges.cloudflare.com` could not obtain a Turnstile token and
   132	  were therefore unable to complete the form at all.

