codex
The failure paths differ: bootstrap lacks a parent-side readiness deadline; the LLM follow-up error is logged but replaced with fallback text; and replay cache invalidation can fail while the response still succeeds. I also found a 30-second screenshot lease around work that can retry past 40 seconds. Some dependencies are absent from the artifact, so their behavior will need explicit probe gates.

